window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Astriel, the last of the Seraphim and the sole protector of Phaedra lives for only one thing: to protect her people. When she is captured by the Human King's fae hunters, led by their cruel captain, Keelan, she is trapped in a new and dangerous world. Her only goal is to find her way out, and find her way home.</p> <p>But there are forces at work beyond her understanding, secrets that must be revealed, and plots uncovered. When she learns the truth of what happened to her family, and of a new threat to her home from a Sorceress with a tool of world-ending power, her fear for her people urges her on.</p> <p>With an unlikely alliance with a man that she is not sure she can trust, looming prophecies, and a cryptic messages of what is to come, she must choose: abandon her very sense of purpose, or face her fate head-on.</p>"; 
